arStrings.szText:
{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After you drink a Healing Potion, gain {c_number}[{SF_10}*100|%|]{/c} Damage Reduction for {c_number}{SF_1}{/c} seconds and summon eye beams that Corrupt enemies for {c_random}{dot:DOT_TOOLTIP}{/c} damage over {c_number}[{SF_5}|1|]{/c} seconds. Then, your Healing Potion becomes disabled for {c_number}{SF_0}{/c} seconds. You may drink your Healing Potion while at full Life.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power grants {c_important}{u}Stealth{/u}{/c} for {c_number}{SF_20}{/c} seconds. After entering {c_important}{u}Stealth{/u}{/c} you deal {c_random}[{SF_23}*100|%x|]{/c} increased Overpower Damage for {c_number}{SF_20}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
